# A card with no mana cost can't be cast for its mana cost (CR 118.6), but an effect that lets it be cast without paying its
# mana cost may be used for it (CR 118.6a). Lotus Bloom has no mana cost: before Omniscience is on the battlefield it is not
# offered as a cast at all (only suspended); once Bot1's Show and Tell has put Omniscience there, Lotus Bloom is cast from the
# hand without paying its mana cost and resolves onto the battlefield.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Show and Tell
Omniscience
Lotus Bloom
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
! Bot1.Hand.Lotus Bloom.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Omniscience)
Bot1.Hand.Lotus Bloom.Cast(Ability: Without paying)

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Omniscience; Lotus Bloom
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island
Exile.Count = 0
